es #1. Do it enough times, and you'll eventually win one!",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_03","Icebreaker Rookie Medal I","T1","During Icebreaker Games #1, complete 3 [Regular Events: Beginner] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Beginner division in Icebreaker Games #1.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_04","Icebreaker Adept Medal I","T1","During Icebreaker Games #1, complete 3 [Regular Events: Advanced] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Advanced division in Icebreaker Games #1.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_05","Icebreaker Expert Medal I","T2","During Icebreaker Games #1, complete 1 [Regular Events: Expert] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Expert division in Icebreaker Games #1.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_06","Icebreaker Defense Medal I","T2","During Icebreaker Games #1, withstand a total of 20 waves in Bastion Defense.","Medal awarded to those who protected their position in Bastion Defense in Icebreaker Games #1.\nSome players form an impregnable wall just by standing there.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_07","Icebreaker Golden Ball Medal I","T2","During Icebreaker Games #1, score a total of 20 goals in Positional Football.","Medal awarded to those who scored a large number of goals in Positional Football in Icebreaker Games #1.\nScoring more goals—that's what it's all about.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_08","Icebreaker Commemorative Medal I","T2","During Icebreaker Games #1, submit 2 sets of photos.","Medal archived with the contestant album.\nMaking an album is a kind of commemoration, and this medal is a commemoration of the creation of that commemoration.",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_09","Icebreaker Fame Medal I","T2","During Icebreaker Games #1, earn a total of 30 titles.","Your name is known throughout the arena—more than one name, in fact.\nWhich one would you prefer to be known by?",0],["medal_activity_act1multi_10","Icebreaker Style Medal I","T1","During Icebreaker Games #1, obtain the outfit Playfellows.","Medal awarded with an outfit. Serves as a tag as well.\nStyle and performance in one. That's the Icebreaker spirit.",0]],"set":["Rhodes Island Icebreaker Games #1 Engraved Medal Set","An engraved medal set commemorating the Rhodes Island Icebreaker Games.\nThe members of Rhodes Island come from all across Terra, from all walks of life. They have different beliefs, different positions, and different ways of doing things, but the Icebreaker Games give them the opportunity to work together."]}}